type: dataset
title: "Ten Topics for Medical Informatics"
abstract: >-
  A living, curated collection of key topics and in-depth literature to get
  started in Medical Informatics research, extending the viewpoint article
  "Ten Topics to Get Started in Medical Informatics Research".
